# 1. the mother sleeps

h mhtera koimatai.

# 2. the mother, that is tired, sleeps

h mhtera, poy einai koyrasmenh, koimatai.

# 3. the mother, who is tired, sleeps

h mhtera, h opoia einai koyrasmenh, koimatai.

# 4. Peter petted the dog

o Petros xaidepse to skyli.

# 5. Peter petted the dog, who is hungry

o Petros xaidepse to skyli, to opoio peinaei. OR to opoio einai peinasmeno.

# 6. Peter, that loves animals, petted the dog, who he adopted.

o Petros, poy einai filozwos, xaidepse to skyli, to opoio yiothetise.

# 7. Peter, who loves animals, petted the dog, whose fur is brown

o Petros, o opoios einai filozwos, xaidepse to skyli, toy opoioy to trixwma einai kafe.

